arges of $124 million, after $24.2 million in FY2025.","cites":["SWKS.restructuring.2026","SWKS.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $2.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $0 in short-term investments, and $2.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebt). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $133 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["SWKS.cash.2026","SWKS.sti.2026","SWKS.debtTotal.2026"]}]},"fin":{"SWKS":{}},"quotes":{"SWKS.q.employees":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"employees","n":10000,"quote":"As of October 2, 2026, our workforce consists of approximately 10,000 employees located around the world, more than 99% of whom are full-time employees.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"ab143813ab6e132e48cd2aa8f406eee23c4dbdc9a387ad971acab389a9b50f5c"}}}